    <comment>Shown when the post-checkout confirmation poll gives up (2 minutes) without the server confirming the subscription. The purchase is still likely to land later; the background poll and the next launch pick it up. On apple: the delayed phase of PurchaseSuccessView and the MainView snackbar.</comment>
